      "claim": "Destroy arms recorded no signal-abort and sampled successful release reads 1,100,200,300 after client close. RST arms stopped at sampled release read 1. These are observations within the recorded phase, not proof that a callback can never run.",
      "classification": "verified-existing-linux-artifact"
